5355	<div class="sk-bx sk-talk" style="text-align:center"><h3>End of Chapter 3: "Anchored Harbor"</h3><p>As the Rusty Airship slowly settled onto the dock, the trapped wind rushed into the harbor all at once.</p><p>The moored airships' sails swell. The wind now flows higher, beyond the clouds.</p><p style="font-size:13px;color:#8a7458">⟨0⟩ Lv ⟨1⟩ · Murklings defeated ⟨2⟩ · Played ⟨3⟩ min<br>Cross to Chapter 4, the Upside-down Forest, from the "Windways" at the Pinwheel Beacon (travel).</p><button class="sk-b p" data-a="x">Keep exploring</button></div>
